---
import Base from '@/layouts/Base.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '@/components/Breadcrumbs.astro';

const crumbs = [{ label: 'Home', href: '/' }, { label: 'Care & support' }];
const topics = [
  ['Cleaning', 'Cleaning guidance for your model and its timber.'],
  ['Timber maintenance', 'How to look after the exterior and interior timber.'],
  ['Ventilation', 'Guidance for your configuration.'],
  ['Heater care', 'Guidance from the heater manufacturer for the heater you have.'],
  ['Periods of non-use', 'What to do if the sauna is not used for a while.'],
];
---
<Base
  title="Outdoor Sauna Care & Support | Alder & Ember"
  description="How aftercare works with Alder & Ember: a first point of contact after handover, and care guidance for your model and equipment."
  breadcrumbs={crumbs}
>
  <header class="page-head container">
    <Breadcrumbs items={crumbs} />
    <h1>Care &amp; support</h1>
    <p class="lead">After handover you have an accessible first point of contact for care questions and problems.</p>
  </header>

  <section class="section section--flush-top" aria-labelledby="contact-title">
    <div class="container grid-12">
      <div class="c-4 side">
        <p class="label muted">Who to ask</p>
        <h2 id="contact-title">Your first point of contact</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="c-7 c-start-6 prose">
        <p>We give you contact details for aftercare at handover. If something is not right, start there, and we will either help directly or point you to the equipment manufacturer.</p>
        <p>Have a question about a sauna you already have? <a href="/plan-your-sauna">Send us a message</a> and say that it is a care question.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section is-surface" aria-labelledby="guidance-title">
    <div class="container grid-12">
      <div class="c-4 side">
        <p class="label muted">Care guidance</p>
        <h2 id="guidance-title">Looking after your sauna</h2>
        <p class="muted" style="margin-top: var(--sp-1)">Guidance is specific to your model and equipment. We take you through it at handover, rather than giving general advice.</p>
      </div>
      <ul class="c-8 care-grid">
        {topics.map(([t, d]) => (
          <li>
            <h3 class="care-grid__t">{t}</h3>
            <p class="muted">{d}</p>
          </li>
        ))}
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="equip-title">
    <div class="container grid-12">
      <div class="c-4 side">
        <p class="label muted">Equipment</p>
        <h2 id="equip-title">Manufacturer documentation</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="c-7 c-start-6 prose">
        <p>Heating equipment comes with its manufacturer’s own documentation, and you should follow it. We do not write safety procedures for heating equipment from general knowledge.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style is:global>
  .care-grid { display: grid; border-top: var(--border); }
  .care-grid li { display: grid; gap: var(--sp-05); padding: var(--sp-1) 0; border-bottom: var(--border); align-content: start; }
  .care-grid__t { font-size: var(--fs-h3); }
  @media (min-width: 47.5rem) { .care-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; column-gap: var(--sp-3); } }
</style>
